+# shop-api
+
+## Money
+
+Store and compute money as integer cents, typed `Cents` from `src/money.ts`. `Cents` is a plain `number` alias, so the compiler accepts fractional values. Convert to integer cents at the boundary and use integer arithmetic throughout (round explicitly when dividing).
+
+## Migrations
+
+A shipped migration is immutable. To change the schema, add a new migration.
+
+## `legacy/`
+
+`legacy/` is frozen. Change it only for security fixes. Make other changes outside it.
+
+## Before pushing
+
+Run `npm test` and `npm run lint`. CI runs both, and both must pass.
